This crate carries code under the MIT licence and data files from Adobe under
their own terms. The three sections below cover, in order: the crate's code,
the Adobe Glyph List, and the Core 14 AFM files.

The files `data/agl/glyphlist.txt` and `data/afm/*.afm` are distributed
unmodified, exactly as published by Adobe. The `.bin` files under `tables/` are
derived lookup tables, generated from those files by this crate's tests; they
are not modifications of any Adobe file.

